# Kandelo patch rationale (S22)
#
# Node needs an object's construction history after user code changes its
# prototype or constructor property. Observe actual construction in the
# engine, but keep the weak history map in bridge-owned realm metadata. The
# generic trace/finishRoots interface preserves the original ephemeron and
# zone-destruction order. Today's properties and the OS cannot reconstruct
# that history; no global or object becomes an extra permanent root.
#
# Source-only cleanup; not rebuilt or behavior-qualified. Retention remains
# subject to README.md: Future work: platform omissions.

